<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3741] Do not clear &quot;Authorization&quot; header if Z-server is running behind proxy</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3741</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There can be a case where Zeppelin-Sever is running as Form-Based-Authentication, however, it can be running behind a proxy which may be requiring Authorization header.&lt;br/&gt;
The idea of this JIRA is to not clear that header when it behind a proxy and control it with config.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
