&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    There can be a case where Zeppelin-Sever is running as Form-Based-Authentication, however, it can be running behind a proxy which may be requiring Authorization header.&lt;br/&gt;
    The idea of this PR is to not clear that header when it behind a proxy and control it with config.&lt;/li&gt;
